# Transmutation Font: "{T}: Create your choice of a Blood token, a Clue token, or a Food token." The choice is made as the ability resolves (CR 608.2d). Bot1 pays for the Font
# with five Moxen on turn 1 and taps it at once (a noncreature artifact has no summoning sickness): it chooses a Blood. On turn 3 it chooses a Clue and on
# turn 5 a Food, one token each time; a token it did not choose is never made.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Transmutation Font
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

